<div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="" data-part="eyebrow">The volcano</p>
<h2 data-node-id="" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">A very large, very symmetrical mountain</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 25.918 46.4" style="width:0.64795em"><use href="{base}/typography/a84f05a44d887cbd2c70.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 82.52 46.4" style="width:2.0629999999999997em"><use href="{base}/typography/a84f05a44d887cbd2c70.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 105.274 46.4" style="width:2.63185em"><use href="{base}/typography/a84f05a44d887cbd2c70.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 82.52 46.4" style="width:2.0629999999999997em"><use href="{base}/typography/a84f05a44d887cbd2c70.svg#word-3" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 238.711 46.4" style="width:5.9677750000000005em"><use href="{base}/typography/a84f05a44d887cbd2c70.svg#word-4" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 182.93 46.4" style="width:4.57325em"><use href="{base}/typography/a84f05a44d887cbd2c70.svg#word-5" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h2>
<p data-part="paragraph">Arenal National Park, [x] minutes away, [x] entry. Trails across old lava flows with the cone above you. Two to three hours walking, not difficult. Go in the morning, because the summit is usually clouded over by midday and clear more often in the dry season.</p>
<p data-part="paragraph">The volcano has not had a major eruption since 2010. You are not going to see lava. You are going to see a very large, very symmetrical mountain, and on a clear morning that is enough.</p></div></section>
