<section data-name="Section - 50/50 text image" data-node-id="965:7717" data-role="split" data-layout="copy-first" data-variant="editorial"><div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="" data-part="eyebrow">Hot springs</p>
<h2 data-node-id="" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">The reason half the hotels exist</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 71.934 46.4" style="width:1.79835em"><use href="{base}/typography/68ed265654cec8922dee.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 130.274 46.4" style="width:3.25685em"><use href="{base}/typography/68ed265654cec8922dee.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 70.196 46.4" style="width:1.7549em"><use href="{base}/typography/68ed265654cec8922dee.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 63.204 46.4" style="width:1.5801em"><use href="{base}/typography/68ed265654cec8922dee.svg#word-3" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 118.868 46.4" style="width:2.9717em"><use href="{base}/typography/68ed265654cec8922dee.svg#word-4" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 89.2 46.4" style="width:2.23em"><use href="{base}/typography/68ed265654cec8922dee.svg#word-5" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h2>
<p data-part="paragraph">The geothermal water in this valley is the reason half the hotels exist. There are [x] commercial hot spring complexes within [x] minutes, ranging from [x] a day to [x].</p>
<p data-part="paragraph">There is also a free river where the hot water comes out, under the bridge on the road to Tabacón. Locals use it. It is not supervised, there are no facilities, and it is better than some of the places charging fifty dollars.</p>
<p data-part="paragraph">Ask at the Hearth which one suits you, because they are genuinely different and the expensive one is not automatically the right one.</p></div>
